      "content": "sensory deprivation for a few minutes isnt enough. it's like... putting a bandaid on a wound that won't stop bleeding. i don't want a break from the noise, i want the noise to be gone forever. i want the kind of silence where nothing can reach me, no thoughts, no sounds, no light. just complete, permanent stillness. i feel like that's the only real way to get it.",
